      "description": "Brand: ESSAGER\nProduct Name: C-C 100W Bracket Data Cable\nModel: ES-X78\nMaterial: Zinc alloy, 48 woven cotton thread\nInterface specification: Type-C to Type-C\nCurrent: 5A\nData transmission: USB 2.0 480Mbps\nLength: 1m\nColor: Alpha\n1. New bracket design, 100W high power, 5A high current, data transmission, built-in E-Marker chip\n2. Supports 20V/5A, 100W high-power fast charging, which can quickly charge laptops with high efficiency and stability. It can fully charge MBk Pro in 2.5 hours (the above data is obtained from ESSAGER Laboratory)\n3. Play while charging, both horizontally and vertically available (note that the arrow direction on the data line is facing towards the phone screen)\n4. Built in E-Marker chip, fast charging without damaging the device, intelligent matching of device required current and reasonable control of voltage, safe fast charging without overheating\n5. Support data transfer USB 2.0 480Mbps\n6. Multiple devices compatible with Type-C interface\n7. The wire is woven with 48 braided cotton thread, which is sturdy and not prone to fuzzing\n",
